  "prefLabel": "Mec 406.04 The Effect of the Signature on the Application Form for the Renewal of Mechanical Business Entity Licenses",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mec 406.04 The Effect of the Signature on the Application Form for the Renewal of Mechanical Business Entity Licenses. The effect of the signature required by Mec 406.03(b)(2) shall be:\n\n(a) The signer's acknowledgement that, under RSA 641:3, I, knowingly making a false statement on the application form is a misdemeanor; and\n\n(b) The signer's certification that the information provided on the renewal application form is complete and accurate to the best of the signer's knowledge and belief.\n\nSource. #10848, eff 7-1-15; ss by #13771, eff 12-10-23 (formerly Saf-Mec 406.04) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Mec 400)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/mec400.html"
